<title>UK: One Brent cargo kept, the other clocked - trade.</title>
<headline>One Brent cargo kept, the other clocked - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>One Brent cargo nominated loading dates on Monday was kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline but the other went unclaimed, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargoes, due to load Jan 14-16, were kept by equity holder Esso and &quot;clocked&quot; to U.S.-based trader Cargill, they added.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
